      <activity id="5be78328-c6be-5232-8f0a-be99ebd62367" activityNameId="0c2ca75f-afa9-52a4-ad46-6d6688e24ba0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper, recycling, no deinking, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, recycling, no deinking, at plant
na;
UUID: 1aa2c590-cf16-37ac-ba21-b73ec07e78b4
This module includes the European recyclin paper production without a deinking step - including pulping of waste paper, paper production, energy production on-site, internal waste water treatment and transports of the auxillaries to the paper mill. Not included is the transport of waste paper to the mill, as this is already included in the used waste paper datasets.; Geography: Data from the former Swiss packaging study, containing information from 1 Swiss producer, used as European average data.
Location: Data from the former Swiss packaging study, containing information from 1 Swiss producer, used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: no information available in CEPI statistics
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1aa2c590-cf16-37ac-ba21-b73ec07e78b4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
